function badgeShapePath(shape){return ({shield:'M50 3 L92 17 L87 77 Q79 103 50 117 Q21 103 13 77 L8 17 Z',classic:'M50 4 Q70 11 91 14 L94 49 Q91 92 50 116 Q9 92 6 49 L9 14 Q30 11 50 4Z',hex:'M50 3 L90 25 L90 78 L50 117 L10 78 L10 25Z',point:'M50 4 L94 23 L83 91 L50 117 L17 91 L6 23Z',arch:'M50 4 Q87 7 92 33 L88 82 Q72 106 50 117 Q28 106 12 82 L8 33 Q13 7 50 4Z'}[shape]||'')}
function badgeSymbolInner(symbol,accent){if(symbol==='ball')return `<circle cx="50" cy="48" r="19" fill="none" stroke="${accent}" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M50 36l9 7-3 11H44l-3-11zM31 43l10 0M59 43h10M38 61l6-7M62 61l-6-7M50 67V55" fill="none" stroke="${accent}" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>`;if(symbol==='crown')return `<path d="M28 59L23 36l16 10 11-19 11 19 16-10-5 23z" fill="${accent}"/><path d="M29 64h42" stroke="${accent}" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>`;if(symbol==='bolt')return `<path d="M57 23L32 53h15l-5 25 27-35H54z" fill="${accent}"/>`;if(symbol==='laurel')return `<path d="M34 66Q21 53 27 34M66 66Q79 53 73 34" fill="none" stroke="${accent}" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M29 55l-10-6M27 45l-9-2M71 55l10-6M73 45l9-2" stroke="${accent}" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>`;if(symbol==='monogram')return '';return `<path d="M50 24l7.3 14.8 16.4 2.4-11.9 11.6 2.8 16.4L50 61.5 35.4 69.2l2.8-16.4-11.9-11.6 16.4-2.4z" fill="${accent}"/>`}
function makeBadgeSvg(cfg=loadSettings().badge,abbr=teamDisplay().abbr){if(cfg.upload)return `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 120"><defs><clipPath id="c"><rect width="100" height="120" rx="10"/></clipPath></defs><image href="${cfg.upload}" x="0" y="0" width="100" height="120" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" clip-path="url(#c)"/></svg>`;const p=cfg.shape==='round'?'':badgeShapePath(cfg.shape);const outer=cfg.shape==='round'?`<circle cx="50" cy="58" r="45" fill="${cfg.primary}" stroke="${cfg.secondary}" stroke-width="6"/><circle cx="50" cy="58" r="37" fill="none" stroke="${cfg.accent}" stroke-opacity=".18" stroke-width="2"/>`:`<path d="${p}" fill="${cfg.primary}" stroke="${cfg.secondary}" stroke-width="6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="${p}" fill="none" stroke="${cfg.accent}" stroke-opacity=".16" stroke-width="2" transform="translate(50 60) scale(.86) translate(-50 -60)"/>`;const symbol=badgeSymbolInner(cfg.symbol,cfg.accent);return `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 120"><g>${outer}${symbol}<text x="50" y="94" text-anchor="middle" fill="${cfg.accent}" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-weight="800" font-size="${abbr.length>2?16:19}" letter-spacing="1">${escapeHtml(abbr)}</text></g></svg>`}
function setCrest(el,cfg,abbr){if(!el)return;el.innerHTML=makeBadgeSvg(cfg,abbr);el.classList.add('svg-crest')}
function patternDefs(kit,id='kitp'){const p=kit.primary,s=kit.secondary;let body=`<rect width="220" height="260" fill="${p}"/>`;if(kit.pattern==='stripes')body+=`<g fill="${s}"><rect x="27" width="26" height="260"/><rect x="80" width="26" height="260"/><rect x="133" width="26" height="260"/><rect x="186" width="26" height="260"/></g>`;else if(kit.pattern==='hoops')body+=`<g fill="${s}"><rect y="44" width="220" height="24"/><rect y="96" width="220" height="24"/><rect y="148" width="220" height="24"/><rect y="200" width="220" height="24"/></g>`;else if(kit.pattern==='halves')body+=`<rect x="110" width="110" height="260" fill="${s}"/>`;else if(kit.pattern==='sash')body+=`<path d="M-30 40L25 0 245 220 190 260Z" fill="${s}"/>`;else if(kit.pattern==='chevron')body+=`<path d="M0 70L110 145 220 70v36L110 181 0 106Z" fill="${s}"/>`;else if(kit.pattern==='geometric')body+=`<g fill="${s}" opacity=".92"><path d="M0 0h70L0 70zM95 0h70L95 70zM190 0h30v70l-30-30zM25 95h70l-70 70zM120 95h70l-70 70zM0 190h70L0 260zM95 190h70l-70 70zM190 190h30v70l-30-30z"/></g>`;return `<pattern id="${id}" width="220" height="260" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">${body}</pattern>`}
function avatarHair(av){const fill='#070b0e';const m={crop:`<path d="M69 69q8-31 41-31t42 31q-17-13-42-12-23 0-41 12z" fill="${fill}"/>`,wave:`<path d="M67 70q4-34 39-34 31 0 46 25-13-9-28-8-15-15-32-2-14 0-25 19z" fill="${fill}"/>`,curls:`<g fill="${fill}">${[[77,49],[93,43],[111,42],[129,47],[143,58],[72,62],[90,58],[109,57],[128,61],[146,72]].map(x=>`<circle cx="${x[0]}" cy="${x[1]}" r="16"/>`).join('')}</g>`,fade:`<path d="M69 67q8-28 40-28 31 0 42 27-19-11-41-11-23 0-41 12z" fill="${fill}"/><path d="M69 67v24q-7-9-7-17 0-5 7-7M151 66v25q7-9 7-17 0-6-7-8" fill="#11181d"/>`,long:`<path d="M66 69q5-35 44-35 39 0 46 35l-2 70-20-26 7-45q-14-13-31-13-18 0-32 14l8 44-22 26z" fill="${fill}"/>`,coil:`<g fill="${fill}">${[[74,52],[89,43],[106,40],[124,43],[141,52],[68,66],[84,61],[102,58],[121,59],[140,65],[151,77]].map(x=>`<circle cx="${x[0]}" cy="${x[1]}" r="15"/>`).join('')}</g>`,bob:`<path d="M64 73q1-40 46-40 46 0 48 40l-7 67-18-7 9-62q-13-17-32-17-21 0-34 17l10 62-20 7z" fill="${fill}"/>`,pony:`<path d="M68 68q6-34 42-34t43 34q-17-14-43-14-24 0-42 14z" fill="${fill}"/><path d="M145 63q31 15 18 66-13-20-29-29z" fill="${fill}"/>`,bun:`<circle cx="111" cy="25" r="23" fill="${fill}"/><path d="M67 69q6-35 43-35 38 0 44 35-16-14-44-14-26 0-43 14z" fill="${fill}"/>`,curlsLong:`<g fill="${fill}">${[[74,54],[90,43],[109,40],[128,44],[145,56],[68,70],[151,72],[68,91],[153,94],[71,115],[149,116]].map(x=>`<circle cx="${x[0]}" cy="${x[1]}" r="16"/>`).join('')}</g>`,longF:`<path d="M64 72q3-40 46-40 45 0 48 40l-3 83-24-24 10-61q-13-16-31-16-20 0-34 17l11 60-25 25z" fill="${fill}"/>`,cropF:`<path d="M68 69q6-32 42-32 34 0 44 31-15-12-44-12-27 0-42 13z" fill="${fill}"/>`};return m[av.hair]||m.crop}
function makeAvatarSvg(player={}){const s=loadSettings(),kit=s.kits.home,av=AVATAR_OPTIONS.find(a=>a.id===(player.avatarId||selectedAvatarId))||AVATAR_OPTIONS[0],num=escapeHtml(player.number||''),abbr=teamDisplay().abbr,badge=svgDataUri(makeBadgeSvg(s.badge,abbr));const head=av.head==='square'?'M78 61Q110 41 143 61L146 96Q143 132 111 143Q78 132 75 96Z':av.head==='round'?'M73 78Q75 46 110 44Q146 46 148 78L145 104Q139 137 110 143Q81 137 75 104Z':'M76 69Q80 43 110 41Q141 43 145 69L144 101Q139 137 110 145Q81 137 76 101Z';return `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 220 270"><defs><radialGradient id="bg"><stop stop-color="#244553"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#07151d"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="face" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#303b42"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#171f24"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#080c0f"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="shine" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity=".14"/><stop offset=".35" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#000" stop-opacity=".18"/></linearGradient>${patternDefs(kit,'shirt')}</defs><rect width="220" height="270" rx="24" fill="url(#bg)"/><ellipse cx="110" cy="265" rx="108" ry="35" fill="#000" opacity=".25"/><path d="M42 270v-60q8-42 49-54l19 14 20-14q41 12 49 54v60z" fill="url(#shirt)"/><path d="M42 270v-60q8-42 49-54l19 14 20-14q41 12 49 54v60z" fill="url(#shine)"/><path d="M91 156l19 14 20-14-7 24h-26z" fill="${kit.accent}" opacity=".92"/><path d="M91 156l19 14 20-14" fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-opacity=".28" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M95 134v27h30v-27" fill="#12191e"/><path d="${head}" fill="url(#face)" stroke="#82949c" stroke-opacity=".22" stroke-width="2"/>${avatarHair(av)}<path d="M80 76Q77 112 92 130M141 75q5 36-11 57" fill="none" stroke="#b7c5ca" stroke-opacity=".12" stroke-width="2"/><image href="${badge}" x="72" y="190" width="27" height="34"/><text x="148" y="226" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-family="Arial" font-weight="800" font-size="30" opacity=".94">${num}</text><path d="M57 220q20-16 33-17M163 220q-20-16-33-17" fill="none" stroke="${kit.accent}" stroke-opacity=".5" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="270" rx="24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".12"/></svg>`}
function avatarDataUri(p){return svgDataUri(makeAvatarSvg(p))}
function playerTileMarkup(p,selected=false,cls=''){return `<label class="player-tile ${selected?'selected':''} ${cls}"><input type="checkbox" data-id="${p.id}" ${selected?'checked':''}><img src="${avatarDataUri(p)}" alt=""><span class="player-tile-number">${escapeHtml(p.number||'–')}</span><strong>${escapeHtml(p.name)}</strong><small>${escapeHtml(p.position||'Player')}</small><i>✓</i></label>`}
function makeKitFallbackSvg(kit,badgeCfg=loadSettings().badge,abbr=teamDisplay().abbr,back=false){
 const badge=svgDataUri(makeBadgeSvg(badgeCfg,abbr)),collar=kit.collar||'crew';
 const neck=collar==='v'?`<path d="M171 42L220 100 269 42" fill="#07141b" stroke="${kit.accent}" stroke-width="10" stroke-linejoin="round"/>`:collar==='polo'?`<path d="M175 39q45 23 90 0-6 46-45 47-39-1-45-47" fill="#07141b" stroke="${kit.accent}" stroke-width="8"/><path d="M174 42l30 38 16-22 16 22 30-38-4 61-42-16-42 16z" fill="${kit.accent}" opacity=".88"/>`:`<path d="M175 39q45 23 90 0-6 54-45 55-39-1-45-55" fill="#07141b" stroke="${kit.accent}" stroke-width="9"/>`;
 const identity=back?`<text x="220" y="175" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="28" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="3">PLAYER</text><text x="220" y="330" text-anchor="middle" fill="white" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="128" font-weight="900">10</text>`:`<image href="${badge}" x="145" y="132" width="58" height="70"/>`;
 return `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 520"><defs><linearGradient id="shade" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop stop-color="#000" stop-opacity=".34"/><stop offset=".2" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity=".10"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset=".82" stop-color="#000" stop-opacity=".18"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#000" stop-opacity=".4"/></linearGradient>${patternDefs(kit,'k')}</defs><g transform="translate(0 5)"><path d="M117 70L175 38Q220 62 265 38L323 70 407 116 358 215 323 190 321 469H119L117 190 82 215 33 116Z" fill="url(#k)"/><path d="M117 70L175 38Q220 62 265 38L323 70 407 116 358 215 323 190 321 469H119L117 190 82 215 33 116Z" fill="url(#shade)"/>${neck}<path d="M39 118l43 97M401 118l-43 97" stroke="${kit.accent}" stroke-opacity=".72" stroke-width="10"/>${identity}<path d="M121 466H319" stroke="${kit.accent}" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="7"/></g></svg>`
}
function careerCounts(playerId){let g=0,a=0,apps=0;for(const m of loadMatches()){if(m.status!=='completed'&&!m.fullTime&&m.id!==activeMatchId)continue;const part=new Set(m.starterPlayerIds||[]);for(const e of m.events||[]){if(e.type==='substitution'&&e.onId)part.add(e.onId);if(e.type==='players_adjust_our'&&e.direction==='on')part.add(e.playerId);if(e.type==='our_goal'&&e.playerId===playerId&&e.goalType!=='own_goal')g++;if(e.type==='our_goal'&&e.assistPlayerId===playerId&&e.goalType!=='own_goal')a++;}if(part.has(playerId))apps++;}return{g,a,apps}}
function getUpcomingMoments(){const ps=loadPlayers(),out=[];for(const p of ps){const c=careerCounts(p.id);for(const [key,label,vals,rank] of [['g','goal',[1,10,25,50,100],5],['apps','appearance',[10,25,50,100],4],['a','assist',[10,25,50],3]]){const next=vals.find(n=>n>c[key]),left=next-c[key];if(next&&left<=2){const title=next===1?`Next ${label} becomes a first ${label}`:left===1?`One ${label} from ${next}`:`${left} ${label}s from ${next}`;out.push({player:p,title,detail:key==='g'?`${c.g} goal${c.g===1?'':'s'} recorded`:key==='apps'?`${c.apps} appearance${c.apps===1?'':'s'} recorded`:`${c.a} assist${c.a===1?'':'s'} recorded`,rank:rank+(left===1?2:0),number:next,type:key})}}}const t=getTeamStats('All');for(const [val,label,vals] of [[t.gf,'team goals',[25,50,100,150]],[t.won,'wins',[5,10,25,50]]]){const n=vals.find(x=>x>val);if(n&&n-val<=2)out.push({title:n-val===1?`One ${label.slice(0,-1)} from ${n}`:`${n-val} ${label} from ${n}`,detail:`${val} ${label} recorded`,rank:3,number:n,type:'team'})}return out.sort((a,b)=>b.rank-a.rank).slice(0,6)}
function flashEvent(text){const el=$('eventFeedback');if(!el)return;$('eventFeedbackText').textContent=text;el.classList.remove('hidden','play');void el.offsetWidth;el.classList.add('play');navigator.vibrate?.(28);setTimeout(()=>el.classList.add('hidden'),720)}
function showMoment(moment){if(!moment||!$('momentDialog'))return;const p=moment.player;$('momentBigNumber').textContent=moment.number;$('momentTitle').textContent=moment.type==='g'?'GOALS':moment.type==='apps'?'APPEARANCES':moment.type==='a'?'ASSISTS':'MOMENT';$('momentPlayerName').textContent=p?.name||teamDisplay().name;const c=p?careerCounts(p.id):null;$('momentDetail').textContent=p?`${c.g} goal${c.g===1?'':'s'} · ${c.apps} appearance${c.apps===1?'':'s'}`:'A new club milestone.';$('momentAvatar').innerHTML=p?`<img src="${avatarDataUri(p)}" alt="">`:makeBadgeSvg(loadSettings().badge,teamDisplay().abbr);$('momentDialog').showModal()}
function showGoalCelebration(e){const m=currentMatch(),p=loadPlayers().find(x=>x.id===e.playerId);if(!$('goalCelebration'))return;setCrest($('goalCelebrationCrest'),loadSettings().badge,teamDisplay().abbr);$('goalCelebrationPlayer').textContent=p?.name||'GOAL';$('goalCelebrationScore').textContent=`${m.ourScore} – ${m.theirScore}`;$('goalCelebration').classList.remove('hidden','play');void $('goalCelebration').offsetWidth;$('goalCelebration').classList.add('play');navigator.vibrate?.([30,35,55]);setTimeout(()=>{$('goalCelebration').classList.add('hidden');if(p){const c=careerCounts(p.id),mil=[1,10,25,50,100].find(n=>n===c.g);if(mil)showMoment({player:p,number:mil,type:'g'})}},1250)}

function formatDate(v){if(!v)return'Unknown date';return new Date(`${v}T00:00:00`).toLocaleDateString(undefined,{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'})}
function periodLabel(p){return p===1?'1H':'2H'}
function goalTimeLabel(e){return `${periodLabel(e.period)} ${e.minute}'${e.goalType==='penalty'?' PEN':''}`;}
function showView(view){Object.values(views).forEach(v=>v?.classList.add('hidden'));if(!view)return;const immersive=[views.onboardingView,views.matchSetupView,views.liveMatchView,views.matchReportView,views.momentsView].includes(view);document.body.classList.toggle('immersive-view',immersive);document.body.classList.toggle('home-view',view===views.homeView);view.classList.remove('hidden');view.classList.remove('screen-enter');void view.offsetWidth;view.classList.add('screen-enter');window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'auto'});if(view===views.homeView)renderHome();if(view===views.matchesView)renderMatchesView();if(view===views.statsView)renderStatsView();if(view===views.settingsView)renderSettings();}
function updatePlanRadios(){const plan=loadSettings().planPreview||'free';document.querySelectorAll('[name="planPreview"]').forEach(r=>{r.checked=plan===r.value});const status=$('planPreviewStatus');if(status)status.textContent=plan==='platinum'?'Previewing ⭐ Platinum':'Previewing Free'}
function applyCrestStyle(el,primary,secondary){if(!el)return;setCrest(el,{...loadSettings().badge,primary:primary||loadSettings().badge.primary,secondary:secondary||loadSettings().badge.secondary},teamDisplay().abbr)}
function refreshIdentity(){const s=loadSettings(),t=teamDisplay();setCrest($('homeTeamCrest'),s.badge,t.abbr);setCrest($('settingsTeamCrest'),s.badge,t.abbr);if($('homeTeamName'))$('homeTeamName').textContent=t.name;if($('homeSeasonMeta'))$('homeSeasonMeta').textContent=`${s.ageGroup?`${s.ageGroup} · `:''}Season ${s.season||'2026/27'}`;if($('settingsTeamPreviewName'))$('settingsTeamPreviewName').textContent=t.name}
function renderSettings(){const s=loadSettings();if($('teamName'))$('teamName').value=s.teamName||'Your Team';if($('teamAbbr'))$('teamAbbr').value=cleanAbbr(s.teamAbbr,'YTM');if($('matchFormat'))$('matchFormat').value=String(s.matchFormat);if($('playersOnPitch'))$('playersOnPitch').value=s.playersOnPitch;if($('ageGroup'))$('ageGroup').value=s.ageGroup||'';if($('season'))$('season').value=s.season||'2026/27';if($('primaryColor'))$('primaryColor').value=s.primaryColor||'#25df72';if($('secondaryColor'))$('secondaryColor').value=s.secondaryColor||'#0b2a38';const sq=$('squadSize');if(sq?.closest('label'))sq.closest('label').style.display='none';updatePlanRadios();renderPlayers();refreshIdentity();renderTeamPreview()}
function renderPlayers(){const ps=loadPlayers();if($('squadCount'))$('squadCount').textContent=`${ps.length} players`;if(!$('playerList'))return;$('playerList').innerHTML=ps.length?`<div class="settings-player-grid">${[...ps].sort((a,b)=>(Number(a.number)||999)-(Number(b.number)||999)).map(p=>`<button class="settings-player-card" type="button" data-edit-player="${p.id}"><img src="${avatarDataUri(p)}" alt=""><span><strong>${escapeHtml(p.name)}</strong><small>#${escapeHtml(p.number||'–')} · ${escapeHtml(p.position||'Player')}</small></span><b>›</b></button>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty-state"><strong>No players yet</strong><span>Add a player to begin building your squad.</span></div>';document.querySelectorAll('[data-edit-player]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openEditPlayer(b.dataset.editPlayer));}
let editingPlayerId=null;
function openPlayerDialog(id=null){editingPlayerId=id;const p=id&&loadPlayers().find(x=>x.id===id);$('playerDialogTitle').textContent=p?'Edit player':'Add player';$('playerName').value=p?.name||'';$('playerNumber').value=p?.number||'';$('playerPosition').value=p?.position||'';$('deletePlayerBtn').classList.toggle('hidden',!p);$('playerDialog').showModal();$('playerName').focus()}
